NOTE ON DATA AND MODELS — the MIT grant above covers THIS SOURCE CODE ONLY.

Datasets and model weights carry their own, different terms:

  Common Voice zh-TW        CC0-1.0        used to build the training corpus
  AISHELL-3                 Apache-2.0     supported corpus source
  MDSC / AISHELL-6B         CC BY-NC 4.0   non-commercial only
  EasyCall                  CC BY-NC 2.0   non-commercial only
  TORGO, UASpeech           restricted     signed licence required, not included

Anything trained on a non-commercial corpus inherits that restriction. A model
fine-tuned on MDSC or EasyCall may not be used commercially regardless of this
MIT licence.

Published model weights are hosted separately and are not covered here.

No dataset files are contained in this repository.
